#. ja: 灰白珊瑚
#. de: Kreidekoralle
#. fr: corail cendré
#. column 2: chalky coral
#. column 8: It should come as no surprise that a coral of such remarkable writing capacity is often used for marking by merchants in the Near East─the region from which it hails. Indeed, such is its utility that it has come to be considered a tool of the trade.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Chalky Coral
msgctxt "Item:36663:0:0"
msgid "chalky coral"
msgstr "меловой коралл"

