#. de: Aufzieh-Koyo-Koyo
#. fr: Koyo K miniature
#. column 2: wind-up PuPus
#. column 8: Will bleed you dry of elixirs if you aren't careful.<br><br>Use item to acquire the wind-up PuPu minion.
#. column 9: Wind-up PuPu
msgctxt "Item:36861:0:0"
msgid "wind-up PuPu"
msgstr "Заводной Пу-Пу"

#. de: Aufzieh-Koyo-Koyos
#. fr: Koyo K miniatures
#. column 0: wind-up PuPu
