#. ja: クロックワーク・ソル
#. de: Aufzieh-Solus
#. fr: Solus mécanique
#. column 2: clockwork Soluses
#. column 8: No lands must remain beyond its grasp. Go forth. Conquer. Rule.<br><br>Use item to acquire the clockwork Solus minion.
#. column 9: Clockwork Solus
msgctxt "Item:36862:0:0"
msgid "clockwork Solus"
msgstr "Заводной Солус"

#. de: Aufzieh-Solus
